le Labs,Developer tools","go_live_date_time":"2026-06-01|16:00","days_since_published":26,"content_category":"Editorial feature","word_count":1474,"summary":"Learn how Googlers used AI to produce Google I/O 2026.","full_url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/io-2026-google-ai/","url":"/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/io-2026-google-ai/","published":"2026-06-01T16:00:00Z","hero":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/AI_IO.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","main_hero_image":null,"category":"article","tag":"ai","tag_eyebrow":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/","tag_name":"AI","eyebrow":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-06-01 16:00:00+00:00\" aria-label=\"June 01\">Jun 01</time> / AI","show_byline":true,"sitespace":"","sitespace_render":"","published_node":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-06-01 16:00:00+00:00\">Jun 01</time>","published_readable_date":"Jun 01","body_text":null,"short_body":null,"footnotes_list":[]},{"page_id":85125,"headline":"Take our I/O 2026 quiz, vibe coded in Google AI Studio.","author":"Zahra Thompson","author_list":[{"display_name":"Zahra Thompson","assigned_job_title":"Contributing writer","image_renditions":{"regular":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/zahra_headshot.width-122.format-webp.webp","retina":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/zahra_headshot.width-244.format-webp.webp"},"author_page":"https://blog.google/authors/zahra-barnes/"}],"analytics_properties":{"has_carousel":"no","has_image":"no","has_audio":"no","has_video":"no","hero_media_type":"none"},"content_type":"Short Post","slug":"io-2026-vibe-coded-quiz","tags":"products-developer-tools,ai","secondary_tags":"Developer tools","go_live_date_time":"2026-05-29|19:00","days_since_published":29,"content_category":null,"word_count":0,"summary":"We used Google AI Studio to vibe code a quiz about our top I/O 2026 announcements.","full_url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/io-2026-vibe-coded-quiz/","url":"/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/io-2026-vibe-coded-quiz/","published":"2026-05-29T19:00:00Z","hero":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IOQuiz2026_social.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","main_hero_image":null,"category":"short-post","tag":"ai","tag_eyebrow":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/","tag_name":"AI","eyebrow":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-05-29 19:00:00+00:00\" aria-label=\"May 29\">May 29</time> / AI","show_byline":null,"sitespace":"","sitespace_render":"","published_node":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-05-29 19:00:00+00:00\">May 29</time>","published_readable_date":"May 29","body_text":"<div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"mscki\">Heads up, builders and devs: You can test your knowledge of <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/google-io-2026-all-our-announcements/\">our I/O 2026 announcements</a> with this <a href=\"https://ai.studio/apps/bundled/google_io_2026_quiz?fullscreenApplet=true\">vibe coded quiz</a> built in Google AI Studio.</p><p data-block-key=\"2laeu\">In case you missed it, at <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/google-io-2026-collection/\">Google I/O 2026</a>, we announced <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/google-ai-studio-io-2026/\">new ways and places you can use Google AI Studio</a>. With Google AI Studio, powered by the Antigravity coding agent, you can bring ideas to life with the latest Gemini models even if you’re not a seasoned developer.</p><p data-block-key=\"6fntu\">As a case in point, I vibe coded this quiz myself — and I'm an editor with zero coding background, not a developer. To make the quiz, I used <a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/\">Gemini</a> to generate a prompt for Google AI Studio to build the exact quiz I envisioned. I uploaded sources including announcements and design inspiration. Gemini delivered a helpful, creative, highly specific prompt I took to Google AI Studio. I refined the prompt based on the previews, and added the actual quiz text.</p><p data-block-key=\"795ti\">Check out the quiz to get to know Google AI Studio, then <a href=\"http://aistudio.google.com/apps\">try building something yourself</a>.</p></div>","short_body":[{"type":"perspective_qa","value":{"article":null,"external_url":"https://ai.studio/apps/bundled/google_io_2026_quiz?fullscreenApplet=true","eyebrow_override":"","title_override":"Google I/O 2026: Pop Quiz","hide_image":false,"image":{"id":67663,"renditions":{"medium":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IOQuiz2026_social.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IOQuiz2026_social.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","width":300,"height":168,"alt":"IOQuiz2026_social"},"medium_retina":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IOQuiz2026_social.max-600x600.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IOQuiz2026_social.max-600x600.format-webp.webp","width":600,"height":337,"alt":"IOQuiz2026_social"}}},"image_alt_text":"The words I/O quiz in rainbow colors against a black background","summary_override":"Click each icon to test your knowledge of our I/O announcements about new Gemini models, Search updates and more.","cta_override":""},"id":"d394c5ed-d6a5-4dae-a4dd-c935921bd6fe"}],"footnotes_list":[]},{"page_id":85124,"headline":"Here's what developers can do with the latest Google Play updates.","author":"","author_list":[],"analytics_properties":{"has_carousel":"no","has_image":"no","has_audio":"no","has_video":"yes","hero_media_type":"none"},"content_type":"Short Post","slug":"google-play-updates-google-io-2026","tags":"google-play,products-developer-tools","secondary_tags":"Developer tools","go_live_date_time":"2026-05-21|17:00","days_since_published":37,"content_category":null,"word_count":0,"summary":"At Google I/O, we introduced new ways for developers to expand their reach and scale their business with less complexity.We’re expanding th…","full_url":"https://blog.google/feed/google-play-updates-google-io-2026/","url":"/feed/google-play-updates-google-io-2026/","published":"2026-05-21T17:00:00Z","hero":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IO26_313_PKLS_2.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","main_hero_image":null,"category":"short-post","tag":"google-play","tag_eyebrow":"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/platforms/google-play/","tag_name":"Google Play","eyebrow":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-05-21 17:00:00+00:00\" aria-label=\"May 21\">May 21</time> / Google Play","show_byline":null,"sitespace":"","sitespace_render":"","published_node":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-05-21 17:00:00+00:00\">May 21</time>","published_readable_date":"May 21","body_text":"<div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"j9krp\">At Google I/O, we introduced new ways for developers to expand their reach and scale their business with less complexity.</p><p data-block-key=\"1t1oq\">We’re expanding their reach by meeting users where they are.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"91s6j\"><b>On the Store:</b> Play Shorts provides a glimpse into an app’s look, feel and functionality, while Ask Play allows conversational search for finding the right app.</li><li data-block-key=\"fcbba\"><b>Beyond the Store:</b> We’re surfacing apps directly in the Gemini app on Android and web while expanding content discovery across more surfaces via Engage SDK.</li><li data-block-key=\"3jkgg\"><b>In games:</b> Play Games Sidekick, our in-game overlay that gives players instant access to gaming information, including tips, rewards and new social updates to deepen player connections.</li></ul><p data-block-key=\"7kmhm\">Learn more about these updates and the ways we’re helping developers grow their businesses on Google Play in our <a href=\"https://goo.gle/play-io26\">Android developer blog post</a> or watch the <a href=\"https://goo.gle/whats-new-in-play-io26\">I/O keynote</a> recording.</p></div>","short_body":[{"type":"video","value":{"video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fwLiTPtPHjw","alt_text":"YouTube video showing speakers on stage going over Google Play's announcement's at I/O","image":{"id":67677,"renditions":{"small":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-100x100.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-100x100.format-webp.webp","width":100,"height":56,"alt":"unnamed"},"small_retina":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-200x200.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-200x200.format-webp.webp","width":200,"height":112,"alt":"unnamed"},"medium":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-500x500.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-500x500.format-webp.webp","width":500,"height":281,"alt":"unnamed"},"medium_retina":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-1000x1000.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-1000x1000.format-webp.webp","width":1000,"height":562,"alt":"unnamed"},"large":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-1000x1000.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-1000x1000.format-webp.webp","width":1000,"height":562,"alt":"unnamed"},"large_retina":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gwe